#ASSERT `Does my Commonwealth enrolment reach the State register of electors` `as the elector` TRUE `directly by the Australian Electoral Commission under Commonwealth section 103A or 103B` `an unasked fact` FALSE EQUALS `it does not reach the register: you must send a State claim`
