#ASSERT `Am I entitled to vote at this State election` `as the elector` (`a non-citizen elector of 1983, as asked` TRUE FALSE FALSE) `8 March 2025` EQUALS `yes if` (`Am I entitled to vote` (`a non-citizen elector of 1983` TRUE FALSE FALSE) `8 March 2025`)
-- s 18(1)(b), (2): convicted of treason, not pardoned: barred from enrolment and from voting, not qualified.
