#ASSERT `Must I vote at this State election` `as the elector` `Chloe, as asked` `8 March 2025` FALSE TRUE EQUALS `yes if` (`Must I vote` `Chloe` `8 March 2025` (`What happened at the election` WITH `I voted` IS FALSE, `I was outside the State, and that prevented me voting` IS FALSE, `I had a mental or physical impairment on the voting days` IS TRUE, `I honestly believe abstaining from voting is part of my religious duty` IS TRUE, `I had another valid and sufficient reason` IS TRUE, `the Commissioner is satisfied of my absence, ineligibility or reason` IS TRUE))
